    R (>= 4.3.0)
Suggests: 
    here,
    ncdf4,
    rcdo,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vcr
Imports: 
    cli,
    digest,
    glue,
    httr2,
    rlang
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/eliocamp/icecdr, https://eliocamp.github.io/icecdr/
BugReports: https://github.com/eliocamp/icecdr/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
